## Deferred (medium/high risk), in suggested order
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Result buffer instead of kernel printf, host-side decode and print.
2. Batched launches with progress output and Ctrl-C handling.
3. CACHE_SIZE per filter, with a bounds check in init_node.
4. locked[] bitset.
5. pseudohash continuation (hash the seed once per seed).
6. s_skip small-stride specialization.
7. GF(2) jump-ahead for the LuaJIT warmup (largest remaining ALU win,
   needs bit-exact validation harness first).
8. roundDigits divide -> reciprocal multiply (only if validated bit-exact).

